#: rip/k3bcddbpatternwidget.cpp:153
msgid ""
"<p><b>Conditional inclusion:</b>"
"<p>These patterns make it possible to selectively include texts, depending on "
"the value of CDDB entries. You can choose only to include or exclude texts if "
"one of the entries is empty, or if it has a specific value. Examples:"
"<ul>"
"<li>@T{TEXT} includes TEXT if the album title is specified"
"<li>!T{TEXT} includes TEXT if the album title is not specified"
"<li>@C='Soundtrack'{TEXT} includes TEXT if the CD's extended information is "
"named Soundtrack"
"<li>!C='Soundtrack'{TEXT} includes TEXT if the CD's extended information is "
"anything else but Soundtrack"
"<li>It is also possible to include special strings in texts and conditions, "
"e.g. !a='%A'{%a} only includes the title's artist information if it does not "
"differ from the album artist.</ul>"
"<p>Conditional includes make use of the same characters as the special strings, "
"which means that the X in @X{...} can be one character out of [atnycgATCd]."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>\"Bedingt tofögen\":</b>"
"<p>Mit dissen Muster lett sik, je na Weert vun de CDDB-Indrääg, dor binnen Text "
"infögen. Dorbi lett sik bloots Text in- oder utslaten, wenn een vun de Indrääg "
"leddig is, oder en besünneren Weert hett. Bispeel:"
"<ul>"
"<li>@T{TEXT} hett TEXT binnen, wenn de Albumtitel angeven is"
"<li>!T{TEXT} hett TEXT binnen, wenn de Albumtitel nich angeven is"
"<li>@C=\"Toonspoor\"{TEXT} hett TEXT binnen, wenn de verwiedert "
"CD-Informatschoon \"Toonspoor\" heet"
"<li>!C=\"Toonspoor\"{TEXT} hett TEXT binnen, wenn de verwiedert "
"CD-Informatschonen jichtenswat anners as \"Toonspoor\" binnen hett"
"<li>Man kann ok besünnere Tekenkeden in Texten un Bedingen fastleggen, t.B. "
"!a='%A'{%a} hett bloots Informatschonen över den Künstler vun den Stück binnen, "
"wenn he ok de Album-Künstler is.</ul>"
"<p>\"Bedingt tofögen\" bruukt de glieks Tekens as de Sünner-Tekenkeden, so dat "
"dat \"X\" in @X{...} een Teken vun [atnycgATCd] wesen kann."

