msgid ""
"You must load a K3b DVD Project file and \n"
" set a file name for the final AVI."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst en K3b-Projektdatei laden un \n"
"en Dateinaam för dat Teel-AVI fastleggen."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:39
msgid "Wrong setting"
msgstr "Lege Instellen"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:40
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter YUVDeinterlaceMMX doesn't work with RGB mode. You must "
"enable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""
"De Regenutflechten-Filter \"YUVDeinterlaceMMX\" löppt nich mit RGB-Bedrief. Du "
"muttst den YUV-Klörenruum aktiveren."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:42
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter SmartDeinterlace doesn't work with YUV colorspace. It "
"only works with RGB. You must disable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""
"De Regenutflechten-Filter \"SmartDeinterlace\" löppt nich mit YUV-Klörenruum. "
"Du muttst de YUV-Klörenruum deaktiveren."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:52
msgid "Extended Audio/Video Settings"
msgstr "Verwiedert Audio-/Video-Instellen"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:58
msgid "Keyframes:"
msgstr "Slötelbiller"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Keyframes (same as I-frames) are \"full\" pictures of an MPEG-stream. They are "
"similar to a simple JPEG and have the best quality in a video. All pictures "
"following are only stored as differences to a keyframe. Here you can set the "
"maximum distance between two keyframes. In most cases this will rarely be used, "
"as the codec will automatically insert a keyframe on each scene change. Default "
"is 300."
msgstr ""
"Slötelbiller (ok \"I-Frames\") sünd \"Vull\"-Biller in en MPEG-Stroom. Se sünd "
"liek as en JPEG-Bild un hebbt de best Gööd in en Film. All nakamen Biller sünd "
"bloots de Verscheeldaten to dat Slötelbild. Hier lett sik de maximaal Afstand "
"twischen twee Slötelbiller fastleggen. Dat warrt man normaal woll kuum bruukt, "
"wiel de Kodek automaatsch bi elk Szeenännern en Slötelbild insett. Standard is "
"300."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:66
msgid "Crispness:"
msgstr "Scharpde:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:67
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can smooth the video during the encoding process. It is better to "
"leave crispness at 100% for encoding and smooth the video during playback "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik dat Video bi't Koderen week maken. Dat is beter, wenn man de "
"Scharpde bi't Koderen op 100% lett, man denn dat Video bi't Afspelen week "
"maakt."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:72
msgid "Audio language:"
msgstr "Spraak:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Select the language and the surround mode. Typically there are \"MPEG2 "
"Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch and 6ch\" and \"DTS 6ch\". You can probably choose AC3 6ch, "
"AC3 2ch and MPEG2 Stereo in descending order, depending on your language (It "
"doesn't matter if DTS works or not, you can still try it)."
msgstr ""
"Bitte de Spraak för den Ümgevenklang utsöken. Normaal sünd \"MPEG2 Stereo\", "
"\"AC3 2ch un 6ch\" un \"DTS 6ch\". Wohrschienlich kann man vun AC3 6ch, AC3 2ch "
"un MPEG2 Stereo daalwarts utsöken, wat aver vun de Spraak sülven afhangt. (Dat "
"is ok liek, wat \"DTS\" löppt oder nich, dat kann een later versöken)."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:79
msgid "Deinterlace mode:"
msgstr "Regenutflechten-Bedrief"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Select a deinterlace mode if you have interlaced material."
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Fast</strong> is the standard deinterlace mode</li>"
"<li><strong>Encoder Based</strong> uses the internal deinterlace of the codec "
"(be aware that some codecs may have no deinterlacer)</li>"
"<li><strong>Zoom to Full Frame</strong> no matter how it works but it is rather "
"good and slow. Use this if <strong>Fast</strong> still produces interlace "
"stripes or color artifacts (red shadow, etc.)"
"<li>"
"<li><strong>Drop Field/Half Height</strong> uses only one field and scales "
"it.</li>"
"<li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> provides a smart, motion-based "
"deinterlacing capability. Ported from VirtualDub by Tilmann Bitterberg. "
"Operates in RGB space only. Tilmann did some testing of deinterlace filters "
"available in transcode. You can view and read the result on tibit.org/video/. "
"</li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is a deinterlace for YUV mode by Thomas "
"Oestreich.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Söök en Regenutflechtmetood ut, wenn Du regenflecht Saken hest."
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Gau</strong> is de Standard-Regenutflechtmetood.</li>"
"<li><strong>Kodeerbaseert</strong> bruukt de intern Regenutflechtmetood vun den "
"Kodek (beacht, dat en poor Kodek gor keen Regenutflechter binnen hebbt)</li>"
"<li><strong>Op Vullbild grötter maken</strong> De Funktschoon is egol, aver dat "
"is teemlich goot un suutje. Bruuk dat, wenn <strong>Gau</strong> "
"noch Regenflechtenstriepen oder Klöörenartefakten (root Schattens usw.) maakt."
"<li>"
"<li><strong>Bild weglaten / Halve Hööchde</strong> bruukt bloots een Bild, un "
"skaleert dat..</li>"
"<li><strong>PlietschDeinterlace</strong> is en plietsch un filmbaseert "
"Regenutflechtmetood. Tilmann Bitterberg hett dat vun VirtualDub porteert. Löppt "
"bloots in'n RGB-Ruum. Tilmann hett ok en poor Tests mit Regenutflechten-Filters "
"för \"transcode\" maakt. Wat dorbi rutkamen is, kann een sik op "
"tibit.org/video/ ankieken oder ok dor nalesen. </li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is en Regenutflechten för YUV-Bedrief "
"vun Thomas Oestreich.</li></ul>"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:111
msgid "Resample to 44.1 kHz"
msgstr "Aftastwedderhalen op 44.1 kHz ännern"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the audio track will be downsampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 "
"kHz. Useful because some soundcards have problems with a sampling rate of 48 "
"kHz."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit aktiveert is, warrt de Audiotitel vun 48 kHz na 44,1 kHz daalrekent. "
"Dat is bruukbor, wiel en poor Klangkoorten mit en Afspeelrate vun 48 kHz "
"Problemen maakt."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:115
msgid "Use YUV colorspace."
msgstr "YUV Klörenruum bruken"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the internal codec works with the YUV colorspace instead of "
"using RGB. Useful because DVD also has YUV colorspace and it is twice fast as "
"RGB. You only need RGB colorspace if a filter needs it (filters not yet "
"supported)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit aktiveert is, bruukt de intern Kodek den YUV-Klörenruum staats RGB. "
"Bruukbor, wiel DVD ok YUV-Klörenruum hett, un dubbelt so gau as RGB is. "
"RGB-Klörenruum deit bloots denn noot, wenn en Filter em bruukt (Filters warrt "
"noch nich ünnerstütt)."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:121
msgid "0 - None"
msgstr "0 - Keen"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:122
