msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked LAME will enforce the 7680 bit limitation on total "
"frame size."
"<br>\n"
"This  results  in  many  wasted bits for high bitrate encodings but will ensure "
"strict ISO compatibility. This compatibility might be important for hardware "
"players."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon aktiveert is, warrt \"LAME\" de 7680-Bitgrenz op de "
"Rahmengrött verdwingen."
"<br>\n"
"Dat  verkleit  bi  hoge  Bitraten  vele  Bits, man is streng ISO-kompatibel. "
"Dat mag villicht för Hardware-Afspelers wichtig wesen."

