#. i18n: file ../plugins/encoder/lame/base_k3blameencodersettingswidget.ui line 145
#: rc.cpp:1087
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Select the channel mode of the resulting Mp3 file:\n"
"<p><b>Stereo</b>"
"<br>\n"
"In this mode, the encoder makes no use of potential correlations between the "
"two input channels; it can, however, negotiate the bit demand between both "
"channel, i.e. give one channel more bits if the other contains silence or needs "
"fewer bits because of a lower complexity.\n"
"<p><b>Joint-Stereo</b>"
"<br>\n"
"In this mode, the encoder will make use of correlations between both channels. "
"The signal will be matrixed into a sum (\"mid\"), computed by L+R, and "
"difference (\"side\") signal, computed by L-R, and more bits are allocated to "
"the mid channel. This will effectively increase the bandwidth if the signal "
"does not have too much stereo separation, thus giving a significant gain in "
"encoding quality.\n"
"<p><b>Mono</b>"
"<br>\n"
"The input will be encoded as a mono signal. If it was a stereo signal, it will "
"be downsampled to mono. The downmix is calculated as the sum of the left and "
"right channel, attenuated by 6 dB."
msgstr ""
"<p>Söök de Kanaaloort för de Teel-MP3-Datei ut:\n"
"<p><b>Stereo</b>"
"<br>\n"
"In Stereobedrief bruukt de Koderer keen villicht bestahn Verbinnen twischen den "
"twee Ingaav-Kanaals, man en Bit-Nafraag twischen den Kanaals kann ümdreiht "
"warrn, t.B. kann he na den een Kanaal mehr BIts geven, wenn de annere bloots "
"Still bargt, oder ut annern Grünnen weniger Bits bruukt.\n"
"<p><b>Joint-Stereo</b>"
"<br>\n"
"In \"Joint-Stereo\"-Bedrief bruukt de Koderer de bestahn Verbinnen twischen "
"beid Ingaav-Kanaals. Dat Signaal warrt to en Summ (\"mid\") tosamenmischt, wat "
"ut L+R un den vun L-R utrekent Verscheelsignaal (\"side\") utrekent warrt. So "
"laat sik mehr Bits na den mid-Kanaal toornen. Dat gifft denn mehr Bandbreed, "
"wenn dat Signaal nich to veel Stereo-Trennen bargt, un dorwegen ok en bannig "
"beter Kodeergööd.\n"
"<p><b>Mono</b>"
"<br>\n"
"De Ingaav warrt as Mono-Signaal kodeert. Wenn dat vördem Stereo wesen is, warrt "
"dat op Mono daalrekent. Dat daalrekent Signaal is de Summ ut recht un link "
"Kanaal, 6 dB afswackt."

#. i18n: file ../plugins/encoder/lame/base_k3blameencodersettingswidget.ui line 172
#: rc.cpp:1099 rc.cpp:1143
#, no-c-format
