#: projects/k3bdatamultisessioncombobox.cpp:38
msgid "Select the Multisession Mode for the project."
msgstr "Bitte söök de Mehrmaaltörn-Bedrief för dat Projekt ut."

#: projects/k3bdatamultisessioncombobox.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p><b>Multisession Mode</b>"
"<p><b>Auto</b>"
"<br>Let K3b decide which mode to use. The decision will be based on the size of "
"the project (does it fill the whole media) and the state of the inserted media "
"(appendable or not)."
"<p><b>No Multisession</b>"
"<br>Create a single-session CD or DVD and close the disk."
"<p><b>Start Multisession</b>"
"<br>Start a multisession CD or DVD, not closing the disk to allow further "
"sessions to be apppended."
"<p><b>Continue Multisession</b>"
"<br>Continue an appendable data CD (as for example created in <em>"
"Start Multisession</em> mode) and add another session without closing the disk "
"to allow further sessions to be apppended."
"<p><b>Finish Multisession</b>"
"<br>Continue an appendable data CD (as for example created in <em>"
"Start Multisession</em> mode), add another session, and close the disk."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Mehrmaaltörn-Bedrief</b>"
"<p><b>Automaatsch</b>"
"<br>K3b leggt de Bedriefoort fast. De Utwahl is afhangig vun de Projektgrött "
"(warrt de hele Schiev bruukt) un den Schievtostand (lett sik noch wat an "
"anhangen, oder nich)."
"<p><b>Keen Mehrmaaltörn</b>"
"<br>Stellt en Enkeltörn-CD oder -DVD op, un slutt ehr af."
"<p><b>Mehrmaaltörn starten</b>"
"<br>Start en Mehrtörn-CD oder -DVD, man slutt ehr nich af, dormit nakamen Törns "
"anhangt warrn köönt."
"<p><b>Mehrmaaltörn wiedermaken</b>"
"<br>En Daten-CD, wo sik noch wat an anhangen lett, wiedermaken (as t.B. in <em>"
"Mehrmaaltörn starten</em>-Bedrief opstellt) un en annern Törn anhangen. Denn de "
"Schiev nich afsluten, dormit nakamen Törns anhangt warrn köönt.."
"<p><b>Mehrmaaltörn beennen</b>"
"<br>En Daten-CD, wo sik noch wat an anhangen lett, wiedermaken (as t.B. in <em>"
"Mehrmaaltörn starten</em>-Bedrief opstellt) un en annern Törn anhangen. Denn de "
"Schiev afsluten."

