msgstr "Physikaalsch Sorteren ännern"

#: projects/k3bdatapropertiesdialog.cpp:196
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, the file or directory (and its entire contents) "
"will be hidden on the ISO9660 and RockRidge filesystem.</p>"
"<p>This is useful, for example, for having different README files for RockRidge "
"and Joliet, which can be managed by hiding README.joliet on RockRidge and "
"README.rr on the Joliet filesystem.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon aktiveert is, warrt de Datei oder de Orner (un em sien "
"komplett Inholt) vör den ISO9660- un RockRidge-Dateisysteem verstickt.</p>"
"<p>Dat is t.B. sinnvull, wenn een ünnerscheedlich README-Dateien för RockRidge "
"un Joliet hebbt. Dat geiht, wenn een de README.joliet in den Rockridge-, un de "
"README.rr in den Joliet-Dateisysteem verstickt.</p>"

#: projects/k3bdatapropertiesdialog.cpp:203
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, the file or directory (and its entire contents) "
"will be hidden on the Joliet filesystem.</p>"
"<p>This is useful, for example, for having different README files for RockRidge "
"and Joliet, which can be managed by hiding README.joliet on RockRidge and "
"README.rr on the Joliet filesystem.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon aktiveert is, warrt de Datei oder de Orner (un em sien "
"komplett Inholt) vör den Joliet-Dateisysteem verstickt.</p>"
"<p>Dat is t.B. sinnvull, wenn een ünnerscheedlich README-Dateien för RockRidge "
"un Joliet hebbt. Dat geiht, wenn een de README.joliet in den Rockridge-, un de "
"README.rr in den Joliet-Dateisysteem verstickt.</p>"

#: projects/k3bdatapropertiesdialog.cpp:210
msgid ""
"<p>This value modifies the physical sort order of the files in the ISO9660 "
"filesystem. A higher weighting means that the file will be located closer to "
"the beginning of the image (and the disk)."
"<p>This option is useful in order to optimize the data layout on a CD/DVD."
"<p><b>Caution:</b> This does not sort the order of the file names that appear "
"in the ISO9660 directory.It sorts the order in which the file data is written "
"to the image."
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Weert ännert de physikaalsch Dateianornen in den ISO9660-Dateisysteem. "
"Högere Gewichten bedüüdt, dat de Datei mehr an'n Anfang vun den Afbild (un de "
"Schiev-) stahn warrt."
"<p>Disse Optschoon is för't Platzoptimeren op de CD/DVD bruukbor."
"<p><b>Wohrscho:</b> Dit ännert nich de Dateinaam-Sorteren in den ISO9660-Orner. "
"Dat gifft de Rangfolg vun Dateidaten an, woans se na dat Afbild schreven warrt."

