#: projects/k3baudioburndialog.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will <em>hide</em> the first track."
"<p>The audio CD standard uses pregaps before every track on the CD. By default "
"these last for 2 seconds and are silent. In DAO mode it is possible to have "
"longer pregaps that contain some audio. In this case the first pregap will "
"contain the complete first track."
"<p>You will need to seek back from the beginning of the CD to listen to the "
"first track. Try it, it is quite amusing."
"<p><b>This feature is only available in DAO mode when writing with cdrdao."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoonaktiveert is, warrt K3b den eersten Titel <em>"
"versteken</em>."
"<p>De Audio-CD-Standard bruukt Vörpausen vör elk CD-Titel. Normalerwies sünd "
"dat twee Sekunnen Still. In \"Schiev-op-eenmaal\"-Bedrief köönt de \"Vörstill\" "
"länger as twee Sekunnen duern, un dor köönt ok noch wat Kläng binnen wesen. "
"Denn bargt de eerste Vörstill dat komplett eerste Stück."
"<p>Du muttst denn aver ok vun'n CD-Anfang torüchsöken, wenn Du den eersten "
"Titel hören wullt. Versöök dat maal, dat is teemlich amüsant."
"<p><b>Disse Funkschoon gifft dat bloots in \"Schiev-op-eenmaal\"-Bedrief, bi't "
"Brennen mit \"cdrdao\"."

